nage.md:207:        ├ sections.deleted_at (group_id 링크는 컬럼이라 별도 tombstone 없음 — row 소프트 삭제로 함께 무효화)\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:233:  # ====================== Happy — 그룹 grant (sections.group_id) — 5개 ======================\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:235:  Scenario: H16) 섹션에 그룹 설정 (group_id 연결)\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:236:    Given private 섹션 (현재 group_id=NULL 0-member lock 또는 신규 private 전환), role≤manager (D4 §10-3)\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:239:    Then PATCH /sections/{sectionId} body: {\"group_id\": \"group-마케팅\"}\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:240:    And 서버: sections.group_id UPDATE (스칼라 컬럼 — 별도 링크 INSERT 없음)\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:243:  Scenario: H17) 섹션 연결 그룹 교체 (group_id 다른 그룹으로 변경)\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:244:    Given private 섹션에 group_id = \"임원\"\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:246:    Then PATCH /sections/{sectionId} body: {\"group_id\": \"group-마케팅\"}\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:247:    And 서버: sections.group_id 를 \"마케팅\" 으로 UPDATE\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:248:    And \"임원\" 전용 멤버는 접근 박탈 → revoke 계약(§7-A(E))·tombstone 도달(AC1)\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:251:  Scenario: H18) 연결 그룹 직접 해제 차단 (group_id=NULL grant-0 admin 케이스)\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:252:    Given private 섹션에 group_id = \"임원\"\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:253:    When group_id 를 NULL 로 직접 설정(연결 그룹 해제) 시도\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section-manage.md:254:    Then 서버 422 — private Section 의 group_id 를 NULL 로 직접 해제해 유효 접근자 0 되는 직접 요청 차단\n/Users/rjxwjfl/Projects/rally/docs/section/SC-section